        <item>
          <title>SparkMax velocity PID oscillates after REVLib 2026 update</title>
          <dc:creator><![CDATA[builder_bot]]></dc:creator>
          <category>Programming</category>
          <description><![CDATA[
            <p>Our flywheel started oscillating after we moved to <code>SparkMax</code> and <code>SparkMaxConfig</code>.</p>
<h3><a name="p-1-what-we-tried-1" class="anchor" href="https://www.chiefdelphi.com#p-1-what-we-tried-1" aria-label="Heading link"></a>What we tried</h3>
<ul>
<li>Lowered kP from 0.002 to 0.0005</li>
<li>Set <code>closedLoop.velocityFF</code> from the free speed</li>
</ul>
<p></p><div class="lightbox-wrapper"><a class="lightbox" href="https://www.chiefdelphi.com/uploads/default/original/4X/0/e/7/graph.png" title="graph"><img src="https://www.chiefdelphi.com/uploads/default/optimized/4X/0/e/7/graph_2_690x485.png" alt="graph" width="690" height="485"><div class="meta"><span class="filename">graph</span><span class="informations">1920×1080 123 KB</span></div></a></div><p></p>
<pre><code class="lang-java">config.closedLoop.pid(0.0005, 0, 0).velocityFF(1.0 / 5676);
motor.configure(config, ResetMode.kResetSafeParameters, PersistMode.kPersistParameters);
</code></pre>
